t":"Those who say, \"Our Lord, indeed we have believed, so forgive us our sins and protect us from the punishment of the Fire,\"","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"3:17","t":"The patient, the true, the obedient, those who spend [in the way of Allāh], and those who seek forgiveness before dawn.","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"3:18","t":"Allāh witnesses that there is no deity except Him, and [so do] the angels and those of knowledge - [that He is] maintaining [creation] in justice. There is no deity except Him, the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"3:19","t":"Indeed, the religion in the sight of Allāh is Islām. And those who were given the Scripture did not differ except after knowledge had come to them - out of jealous animosity between themselves. And whoever disbelieves in the verses of Allāh, then indeed, Allāh is swift in [taking] account.","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"3:20","t":"So if they argue with you, say, \"I have submitted myself to Allāh [in Islām], and [so have] those who follow me.\" And say to those who were given the Scripture and [to] the unlearned, \"Have you submitted yourselves?\" And if they submit [in Islām], they are rightly guided; but if they turn away - then upon you is only the [duty of] notification. And Allāh is Seeing of [His] servants.","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"3:21","t":"Those who disbelieve in the signs of Allāh and kill the prophets without right and kill those who order justice from among the people - give them tidings of a painful punishment.","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"3:22","t":"They are the ones whose deeds have become worthless in this world and the Hereafter, and for them there will be no helpers.","j":3,"h":6,"s":3,"a":22,"sd":null}],"juz":3,"hizb":6,"surahs":[3],"sajdah":false}